@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title gc-profiled: schedule, execute, report
actor User
file "Private TOML profiles\ncommand, interval, timeout" as profiles
component "CLI\nvalidate / list / run / logs" as cli
component "User systemd service" as service
package "One daemon per state directory" {
 component "Scheduler\nreload profiles each tick\nmaximum 4 simultaneous jobs" as scheduler
 component "Job supervisor\nprocess group + timeout\nbounded output capture" as supervisor
}
component "External foreground scripts\nexplicit cleanup policy" as scripts
database "Private state directory\natomic status.json\nrotating logs / requests / lock" as state
component "Login HUD\nread-only GC status" as hud
User --> profiles : configure
User --> cli
service --> scheduler : daemon lifecycle
profiles --> scheduler
cli --> state : queue request / inspect result
profiles --> cli : validate
scheduler --> supervisor : due or requested profile
supervisor --> scripts : argv; no implicit shell
scripts --> supervisor : output + exit status
supervisor --> scheduler : completed / failed / timeout
scheduler --> state : heartbeat and profile results
state --> hud : fresh status snapshot
note bottom of hud
HUD never launches cleanup.
An old success does not prove a live daemon.
end note
@enduml
